---
import { ArrowRight, Building2, Check, FileText, Info, Phone, ShieldCheck, Sparkles, Users } from "@lucide/astro";
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../../components/SiteFooter.astro";

const onboardingPath = "/logistics/carrier-onboarding/";
const agreementPath = "/logistics/carrier-agreement/";
const salesPhone = "+12623023626";
const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  name: "Hermes Carrier Support Options",
  description: "A private carrier proposal explaining control, dispatch support scope, commercial terms, and the signature next step.",
  url: "https://hermeslogisticsus.com/logistics/carrier-offer/",
  isPartOf: { "@id": "https://hermeslogisticsus.com/#website" },
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Carrier Support Options | Hermes Logistics"
  description="Review carrier-controlled dispatch support options and continue to a phone-friendly Appendix A review packet."
  robots="noindex,nofollow"
  schema={schema}
>
  <SiteHeader activePath="/paths/logistics/" />
  <main id="main-content" class="carrier-offer-page">
    <section class="offer-hero">
      <div class="offer-rails" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      <div class="shell offer-hero-shell">
        <nav class="offer-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/carrier/">Carrier agreement</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Support options</span></nav>
        <div class="offer-hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Hermes Logistics · Private carrier proposal</p>
          <h1>You keep the decisions. We help carry the workload.</h1>
          <p class="offer-lead">Hermes supports research, communication, negotiation within your instructions, planning, and ordinary document coordination. Your company approves every load and remains responsible for the transportation operation.</p>
          <div class="control-strip">
            <span><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Non-exclusive</span>
            <span><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />No minimum volume</span>
            <span><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Freight funds stay with the carrier or factor</span>
            <span><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Exact percentage appears in Appendix A</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="primary-choice-grid" aria-label="Choose the next step">
          <article class="primary-choice primary-choice-agreement">
            <FileText size={28} aria-hidden="true" />
            <p class="choice-label">Terms are already clear?</p>
            <h2>Confirm the offer and sign</h2>
            <p>Select the support model, enter the exact percentage discussed with Hermes, confirm the company and authorized signer, then sign from a phone.</p>
            <a class="button button-primary offer-primary" href={onboardingPath} data-primary-choice="agreement">Review and sign <ArrowRight size={18} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
            <small>Only the information needed for the agreement review packet is requested before signing.</small>
          </article>
          <article class="primary-choice primary-choice-learn">
            <Info size={28} aria-hidden="true" />
            <p class="choice-label">Still comparing?</p>
            <h2>Understand the boundaries first</h2>
            <p>Review what Hermes may handle, what remains under carrier control, and how payment and termination work.</p>
            <a class="button button-ghost" href="#learn-more" data-primary-choice="learn">See how it works <ArrowRight size={18} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="learn-more" class="section offer-learn" aria-labelledby="learn-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="section-heading offer-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">The simple operating model</p>
          <h2 id="learn-title">Limited support authority. Full carrier operating control.</h2>
          <p>The agreement is designed to let Hermes act as the carrier's identified administrative and dispatch support agent without taking over the carrier's authority, equipment, drivers, safety duties, or final decisions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="responsibility-grid">
          <article class="responsibility-card responsibility-carrier">
            <ShieldCheck size={29} aria-hidden="true" /><p class="eyebrow">The carrier controls</p><h3>The transportation operation</h3>
            <ul><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Accepting or rejecting every load</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Drivers, equipment, safety, insurance, and compliance</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Routes, schedules, expenses, and availability</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Final decisions involving brokers, factors, insurers, and vendors</li></ul>
          </article>
          <article class="responsibility-card responsibility-hermes">
            <Users size={29} aria-hidden="true" /><p class="eyebrow">Hermes may support</p><h3>Research, communication, and coordination</h3>
            <ul><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Load and market research</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Communication and negotiation within carrier instructions</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Rate-confirmation and ordinary document coordination</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Lane, deadhead, scheduling, and carrier-development research</li></ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="plans" class="section offer-plans" aria-labelledby="plans-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="section-heading offer-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Choose the service scope</p>
          <h2 id="plans-title">The percentage is private and carrier-specific.</h2>
          <p>The master agreement intentionally contains no fixed percentage. The carrier confirms the exact commercial term in the private signing form, and the packet writes it into Appendix A. A public URL never carries that percentage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-grid">
          <article class="plan-card">
            <div class="plan-topline"><span>Dispatch Support</span><strong>Appendix A</strong></div>
            <h3>Day-to-day dispatch assistance</h3>
            <p>For carriers who mainly need opportunity research, communication, negotiation support, and basic booking or document coordination.</p>
            <ul><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Carrier approval before every load</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Research and negotiation within instructions</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Ordinary document and invoice follow-up</li></ul>
            <a href={`${onboardingPath}?plan=essential`} data-plan-link="essential">Choose Dispatch Support <ArrowRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
          </article>
          <article class="plan-card plan-card-pro">
            <p class="recommended"><Sparkles size={15} aria-hidden="true" />Broader operating support</p>
            <div class="plan-topline"><span>Operations + Growth</span><strong>Appendix A</strong></div>
            <h3>Dispatch plus planning and development</h3>
            <p>For carriers who want deeper lane planning, route development, customer research, structured handoffs, and operational follow-up.</p>
            <ul><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Everything in Dispatch Support</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Lane, deadhead, and schedule planning</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Shipper, dealer, and repeat-customer research</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Hermes Connect handoffs as released and approved</li></ul>
            <a href={`${onboardingPath}?plan=pro`} data-plan-link="pro">Choose Operations + Growth <ArrowRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
          </article>
          <article class="plan-card">
            <div class="plan-topline"><span>Custom Cooperation</span><strong>Review</strong></div>
            <h3>Define a different scope</h3>
            <p>A custom scope and percentage remain a proposal until Hermes reviews them and both parties sign a matching approved package.</p>
            <ul><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Requested responsibilities</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Proposed percentage</li><li><Check size={17} aria-hidden="true" />New signature after written acceptance</li></ul>
            <a href={`${onboardingPath}?plan=custom`} data-plan-link="custom">Prepare a custom proposal <ArrowRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
            <small>A custom submission never enters live execution automatically.</small>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section offer-objections" aria-labelledby="objections-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="section-heading offer-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Common carrier questions</p><h2 id="objections-title">The agreement answers the questions that usually stop a signature.</h2></div>
        <div class="objection-grid">
          <article><h3>Am I locked in?</h3><p>No. The proposed v3 structure is non-exclusive, has no minimum load volume, and allows termination with written notice.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Can Hermes book anything it wants?</h3><p>No. Hermes may communicate and negotiate within instructions, but the carrier approves every load and material operating term.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Who receives freight money?</h3><p>The carrier or its factor. Hermes receives only the service fee stated in Appendix A.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Do I upload private documents now?</h3><p>No. The signature step does not request W-9s, CDL images, passwords, bank details, VIN lists, or shipment documents.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Are loads or revenue guaranteed?</h3><p>No. The agreement promises a defined support process, not a market result.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Is there a personal guaranty or lien?</h3><p>The v3 attorney-review draft does not include a personal guaranty, UCC lien, automatic card debit, or confession of judgment.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="company" class="section offer-company" aria-labelledby="company-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="section-heading offer-heading"><p class="eyebrow">More than one dispatcher</p><h2 id="company-title">A connected support system around the carrier.</h2><p>The exact team and tools depend on the signed scope, carrier readiness, and released capabilities.</p></div>
        <div class="division-grid">
          <article><Users size={24} aria-hidden="true" /><h3>Logistics Operations</h3><p>Dispatch research, communication, coordination, and operating handoffs.</p></article>
          <article><Sparkles size={24} aria-hidden="true" /><h3>Hermes Connect & IT</h3><p>Structured carrier information, team workflows, and supported digital tools.</p></article>
          <article><Building2 size={24} aria-hidden="true" /><h3>Customer Development</h3><p>Research around shippers, dealers, repeat opportunities, and route hypotheses.</p></article>
          <article><ShieldCheck size={24} aria-hidden="true" /><h3>Process Support</h3><p>Clear records, privacy boundaries, and defined carrier approval points.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section offer-final" aria-labelledby="offer-final-title">
      <div class="shell offer-final-card">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Choose the next step</p><h2 id="offer-final-title">Confirm the exact offer or read the full draft.</h2><p>The current v3 document remains an attorney-review draft. Production execution stays blocked until the approved master, SHA-256, allowed percentage, and production controls are configured.</p></div>
        <div class="offer-final-actions"><a class="button button-primary offer-primary" href={onboardingPath}>Review and sign <ArrowRight size={18} aria-hidden="true" /></a><a class="button" href={agreementPath}>Read full agreement <FileText size={18} aria-hidden="true" /></a><a class="button" href={`tel:${salesPhone}`}><Phone size={18} aria-hidden="true" />Talk to Logistics Sales</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .carrier-offer-page{background:#fff;color:#10204e}.offer-hero{position:relative;padding:8.45rem 0 5rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 84% 12%,rgba(103,91,255,.3),transparent 34%),#071038;color:#fff}.offer-rails{position:absolute;top:5.35rem;right:0;left:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);height:8px}.offer-rails span:nth-child(1){background:#071038}.offer-rails span:nth-child(2){background:#675bff}.offer-rails span:nth-child(3){background:#d7529b}.offer-rails span:nth-child(4){background:#24a69a}.offer-hero-shell{display:grid;gap:2.2rem}.offer-breadcrumbs{display:flex;gap:.55rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);font-size:.84rem}.offer-breadcrumbs a{color:inherit}.offer-hero-copy{max-width:1020px}.offer-hero h1{max-width:14ch;font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6.25rem);line-height:.97}.offer-lead{max-width:76ch;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);font-size:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.2rem);line-height:1.7}.control-strip{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.7rem;margin-top:1.45rem}.control-strip span{display:flex;gap:.42rem;align-items:center;padding:.62rem .78rem;border:1px solid rgba(104,231,164,.25);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(47,158,98,.11);color:#eafff2;font-size:.84rem}.control-strip svg{color:#68e7a4}.primary-choice-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.primary-choice{display:grid;align-content:start;gap:.75rem;padding:clamp(1.35rem,3vw,2rem);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)}.primary-choice>svg{color:#c8c0ff}.primary-choice h2,.primary-choice p{margin:0}.primary-choice h2{font-size:clamp(1.65rem,3vw,2.35rem)}.primary-choice p:not(.choice-label){color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);line-height:1.6}.choice-label{color:#bff7d3;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.primary-choice .button{justify-self:start;margin-top:.35rem}.offer-primary{border:0!important;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7564ff,#a94ee8 56%,#e25291)!important;color:#fff!important}.primary-choice .button-ghost{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);color:#fff}.primary-choice small{color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);line-height:1.5}.offer-heading{max-width:880px}.offer-heading>p:not(.eyebrow){color:#5b6885;line-height:1.7}.responsibility-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.responsibility-card{padding:clamp(1.3rem,3vw,2rem);border:1px solid #dce3f8;border-radius:15px;background:#fff}.responsibility-card>svg{color:#2f9e62}.responsibility-card ul,.plan-card ul{display:grid;gap:.65rem;padding:0;list-style:none}.responsibility-card li,.plan-card li{display:flex;gap:.45rem;align-items:flex-start;color:#53617e}.responsibility-card li svg,.plan-card li svg{flex:none;color:#2f9e62}.offer-plans{background:#f5f7ff}.plan-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.plan-card{position:relative;padding:1.45rem;border:1px solid #dce3f8;border-radius:15px;background:#fff}.plan-card-pro{border-color:#8a7df2;box-shadow:0 17px 42px rgba(82,65,180,.12)}.recommended{display:flex;gap:.35rem;align-items:center;color:#735be9;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase}.plan-topline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem;color:#6a7590;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:850;text-transform:uppercase}.plan-card>a{display:inline-flex;gap:.4rem;align-items:center;margin-top:.75rem;color:#5948d6;font-weight:850}.plan-card small{display:block;margin-top:.65rem;color:#6c7690}.objection-grid,.division-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.objection-grid article,.division-grid article{padding:1.3rem;border:1px solid #dce3f8;border-radius:14px;background:#fff}.objection-grid p,.division-grid p{color:#5b6885;line-height:1.6}.division-grid svg{color:#6b5df2}.offer-company{background:#f5f7ff}.offer-final-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:2rem;align-items:center;padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,3rem);border-radius:17px;background:#071038;color:#fff}.offer-final-card p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:70ch;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);line-height:1.65}.offer-final-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.65rem;justify-content:flex-end}.offer-final-actions>.button:not(.offer-primary){border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);color:#fff}@media(max-width:980px){.plan-grid,.objection-grid,.division-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:800px){.primary-choice-grid,.responsibility-grid,.offer-final-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}.offer-final-actions{justify-content:flex-start}}@media(max-width:620px){.offer-hero{padding-top:7.4rem}.plan-grid,.objection-grid,.division-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.primary-choice .button,.offer-final-actions .button{width:100%;justify-content:center}}
</style>